    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "tcmpable",
      "x": 70,
      "y": 95,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 140,
      "text": "Comparable<T> (natural order)\n• Implemented by the element class\n• Method: compareTo(T o)\n• One natural ordering\n• Used by: Collections.sort(list), TreeSet\n\n<0 before, 0 equal, >0 after",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "strokeColor": "#e5e5e5",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "cmpable",
      "originalText": "Comparable<T> (natural order)\n• Implemented by the element class\n• Method: compareTo(T o)\n• One natural ordering\n• Used by: Collections.sort(list), TreeSet\n\n<0 before, 0 equal, >0 after",
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "id": "cmptor",
      "x": 460,
      "y": 80,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 170,
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "backgroundColor": "#1a4d2e",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeColor": "#22c55e",
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "tcmptor",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "tcmptor",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 95,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 140,
      "text": "Comparator<T> (external order)\n• Separate class/lambda\n• Method: compare(T a, T b)\n• Many possible orderings\n• Used by: sort(list, cmp), TreeSet(cmp)\n\nChaining: comparing(...).thenComparing(...)",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "strokeColor": "#e5e5e5",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "cmptor",
      "originalText": "Comparator<T> (external order)\n• Separate class/lambda\n• Method: compare(T a, T b)\n• Many possible orderings\n• Used by: sort(list, cmp), TreeSet(cmp)\n\nChaining: comparing(...).thenComparing(...)",
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "id": "warn",
      "x": 120,
      "y": 290,
      "width": 660,
      "height": 100,
      "roundness": {
